      "code": "def edit_distance(a, b):\n    if len(a) < len(b):\n        a, b = b, a\n    prev = list(range(len(b) + 1))\n    for i, ca in enumerate(a, 1):\n        curr = [i] + [0] * len(b)\n        for j, cb in enumerate(b, 1):\n            curr[j] = min(\n                prev[j] + 1,\n                curr[j - 1] + 1,\n                prev[j - 1] + (ca != cb),\n            )\n        prev = curr\n    return prev[-1]",
